        1265
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "TO : HEADS OF ALL CITY DEPARTMENTS AND AGENCIES\nFROM : ROBERT F. WAGNER, MAYOR OF THE CITY OF NEW YORK\nSUBJECT : SUMMER JOBS FOR TEEN-AGE BOYS AND GIRLS",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.3425,
          "min": -1.8809
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.012,
          "min": -0.012
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 52,
          "mean": -0.0143,
          "min": -0.5233
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 2967,
        "area_px": 285690,
        "density": 0.01039,
        "chars": 152,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 51.23
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        278,
        1331,
        1672,
        1506
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "As you know the present indications all point to a summer of unrest and possible violence for teen-agers. All public and voluntary agencies of the City are mobilized to provide a network of services to youth in an effort to forestall homicides and gang warfare.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2794,
          "min": -1.4788
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0005,
          "min": -0.0005
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 51,
          "mean": -0.0011,
          "min": -0.0488
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 3788,
        "area_px": 247446,
        "density": 0.01531,
        "chars": 261,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 68.9
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        280,
        1530,
        1754,
        1706
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "While employment is not the sole remedy for dealing with youth delinquency, it has been proven to be a very constructive deterrent. I have appointed a Committee of Industrial Leaders who are committed to finding as many jobs as possible in private industry for these youngsters this summer.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2918,
          "min": -1.5927
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0001,
          "min": -0.0001
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 53,
          "mean": -0.0008,
          "min": -0.0384
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 4323,
        "area_px": 263084,
        "density": 0.01643,
        "chars": 290,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 67.08
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        287,
        1730,
        1680,
        2020
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "In addition, I herewith direct our City departments and agencies to provide employment wherever possible for teen-agers during the vacation months. Lines for temporary replacements and seasonal jobs should be filled by many of these young people. Such employment might include typing, clerical and office work, institutional helpers, work in parks and playgrounds, light labor tasks and any other type of employment which is in accord with our State Labor Laws.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2515,
          "min": -1.2915
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0001,
          "min": -0.0001
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 84,
          "mean": -0.0001,
          "min": -0.0022
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 5777,
        "area_px": 407924,
        "density": 0.01416,
        "chars": 461,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 79.8
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        290,
        2045,
        1627,
        2180
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "The Youth Board has set up machinery to handle all job orders and placements. Please contact Mr. Angelo Melillo at Murray Hill 5-8600 immediately, indicating the number and type of jobs available.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2587,
          "min": -1.3838
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 43,
          "mean": -0.0004,
          "min": -0.0101
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 2351,
        "area_px": 183717,
        "density": 0.0128,
        "chars": 196,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 83.37
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        298,
        2204,
        1684,
        2340
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "I shall expect a report from every City department and agency by September 1st as to how many job opportunities have been made available to our young people.",
